sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as IT Admin
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)

    Note over Admin,DB: Create account
    Admin->>FE: Fill in name, email, initial password, role
    FE->>Admin: Prompt "confirm your password to continue" (PasswordConfirmModal)
    Admin->>FE: Enter own password
    FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/verify-password {password}
    BE-->>FE: 200 verified, or 401
    FE->>BE: POST /api/users {name, email, password, role, department}
    BE->>DB: bcrypt.hash(password), create User with mustChangePassword = true
    alt email already in use
        BE-->>FE: 409 "A user with this email already exists"
    else created
        BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(ACCOUNT_CREATED)
        BE-->>FE: 201 created user
        Note over FE,Admin: Initial password is shared directly by IT Admin -- forced change on first login
    end

    Note over Admin,DB: Deactivate / reactivate an account
    Admin->>FE: Toggle a user's active status
    alt target account is the admin's own account being deactivated
        FE-->>Admin: Blocked client-side (also rejected server-side)
    else different account
        FE->>BE: PATCH /api/users/:id/active {isActive}
        BE->>DB: Update User.isActive
        opt was active, now deactivated
            BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(ACCOUNT_DEACTIVATED)
        end
        BE-->>FE: 200 updated user
    end

    Note over Admin,DB: Change a user's role
    Admin->>FE: Select a new role for a user
    alt target is the admin's own account
        FE-->>Admin: Blocked (self-role-change not allowed)
    else different account
        FE->>BE: PATCH /api/users/:id/role {role}
        BE->>DB: Update User.role
        BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(ROLE_CHANGED)
        BE-->>FE: 200 updated user
    end
